      "doc_id": "36d4d79f5235",
      "text": "Worth the money. Been using this phone for a few weeks, I came from a dumpsterfire $40 phone, so obviously I'm going to be a bit biased. But this is amazing. Apps come up less than a second after hitting them, the camera is capable of HIGH quality recording, and it has specs capable of running psp emulators. So I'm more than happy with it for just $100. The only complaint I have is that the battery life is a bit lacking, but when you're pushing this high of a resolution on a like 3 inch battery I understand.",
